item.description:
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;We help the world run better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;At SAP, we keep it simple: you bring your best to us, and we&apos;ll bring out the best in you. We&apos;re builders touching over 20 industries and 80% of global commerce, and we need your unique talents to help shape what&apos;s next. The work is challenging &#8211; but it matters. You&apos;ll find a place where you can be yourself, prioritize your wellbeing, and truly belong. What&apos;s in it for you? Constant learning, skill growth, great benefits, and a team that wants you to grow and succeed.&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: S&#227;o Paulo, Brazil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#8217;ll build:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SAP Internship Experience Program is SAP&#8217;s global, strategic, paid internship program that provides university students with opportunities to find purpose in their careers. This is more than an internship, it&#8217;s the foundation for a career built on connection, creativity, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Deal Success Center defines and architects how SAP software solutions are implemented for customers across the Americas region (North America and Latin America). The team delivers service solutioning and estimation support for SAP project delivery, working closely with sales and delivery teams to guide customers through strategic approaches that result in comprehensive, high-quality solution proposals. These efforts drive successful outcomes for customers, partners, and SAP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serving as a central hub, the Deal Success Center brings together sales and delivery teams by analyzing customer requirements, developing accurate estimates, and recommending the most effective services for each SAP implementation. The team also continuously enhances its solutioning capabilities by improving processes, tools, and deliverables&#8212;fostering innovation and driving operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To continuously enhance and evolve our capabilities, the team focuses on three key strategic programs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated Solutioning: Establish and implement standardized processes, best practices, and governance models that integrate traditional consulting services with SAP&#8217;s strategic offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerated Frameworks: Leverage solutioning tools and artificial intelligence to enable end-to-end solutioning aligned with corporate objectives, accelerating sales cycles, improving customer outcomes, and increasing delivery efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Excellence: Drive improvements in efficiency and effectiveness across the entire solutioning lifecycle through a clearly defined engagement model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you will contribute to one or more of these strategic programs, gaining valuable insight into the Deal Success Center&#8217;s operations. You may take ownership of specific deliverables or collaborate with team members on cross-program initiatives. Additionally, you may support solution architects in qualifying opportunities, planning resources, and managing solutioning activities for active sales pursuits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#8217;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work under the guidance of team members to deliver high-quality, innovative outputs aligned with one or more strategic programs, consistently meeting established deadlines and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional teams, including sales, delivery, and solution architects, to support the development of comprehensive and competitive solution proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative team environment by actively sharing knowledge, insights, and best practices using platforms such as SharePoint and WorkZone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, refine, and enhance portfolio-based templates, playbooks, and reusable assets to standardize and improve solutioning efficiency and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of internal marketing and communication materials that clearly articulate solution offerings, value propositions, and strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Solutioning activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in analyzing customer requirements, project scope, and key assumptions to contribute to accurate solution design and effort estimation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the qualification, planning, and staffing of sales pursuits by supporting solution architects with research, documentation, and coordination activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage artificial intelligence (AI) tools and solutioning platforms to streamline workflows, automate repetitive tasks, and enhance the quality and speed of deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore opportunities to integrate AI-driven insights into the solutioning process, including data analysis, content generation, and continuous improvement of frameworks and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct research and benchmarking to identify industry trends, emerging technologies, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As part of the solutioning process, you support the:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the as-is situation and goals of a customer for a broad area holistically, translating it into an appropriate business driven roadmap and design based on SAP&apos;s offerings, with a clear focus on customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope definition according to customer requirements and focused on outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identification the right Service Portfolio Items including cross topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-level requirements assessment coordinating with &#8220;on demand&#8221; experts to work on detailed Scope and Solution definition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elaboration of Customer presentations regarding implementation approach, scope and estimates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build bridges between different parts of SAP organization to build one integrated solution for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definition the right delivery mix considering remote/onsite model and ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery Readiness Check to start the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approval and Bid Council&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#8217;re looking for someone who takes initiative, perseveres, and stay curious. You like to work on meaningful innovative projects and are energized by lifelong learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in Business Administration, Computer Science, Information Systems , International Relations or related fields&#160;(maximum two years before graduation) &#8211; mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong competency in Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook, Word, and SharePoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to flourish in an agile, fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in learning and applying the latest technologies to business problems, including artificial intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and proactive learner with the ability to independently research topics and develop informed perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership and facilitation skills in team and group settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy detail-oriented tasks and ability in working with a virtual global team .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical, structured, process-oriented with a logical mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High commitment to deadlines and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Portuguese and English required; Spanish language skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Please submit your CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Bring out your best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP innovations help more than four hundred thousand customers worldwide work together more efficiently and use business insight more effectively. Originally known for leadership in enterprise resource planning (ERP) software, SAP has evolved to become a market leader in end-to-end business application software and related services for database, analytics, intelligent technologies, and experience management. As a cloud company with two hundred million users and more than one hundred thousand employees worldwide, we are purpose-driven and future-focused, with a highly collaborative team ethic and commitment to personal development. Whether connecting global industries, people, or platforms, we help ensure every challenge gets the solution it deserves. At SAP, you can bring out your best.&#160;&#160;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;We win with inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP&#8217;s culture of inclusion, focus on health and well-being, and flexible working models help ensure that everyone &#8211; regardless of background &#8211; feels included and can run at their best. At SAP, we believe we are made stronger by the unique capabilities and qualities that each person brings to our company, and we invest in our employees to inspire confidence and help everyone realize their full potential. We ultimately believe in unleashing all talent and creating a better world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP is committed to the values of Equal Employment Opportunity and provides accessibility accommodations to applicants with physical and/or mental disabilities. If you are interested in applying for employment with SAP and are in need of accommodation or special assistance to navigate our website or to complete your application, please send an e-mail with your request to Recruiting Operations Team: Careers@sap.com.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For SAP employees: Only permanent roles are eligible for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://one.int.sap/me@sap/jobs_and_hiring/employee_referral/region/0000/lang/en&quot;&gt;SAP Employee Referral Program&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;, according to the eligibility rules set in the SAP Referral Policy. Specific conditions may apply for roles in Vocational Training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to their age, race, religion, national origin, ethnicity,&#160; gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, et al), sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, protected veteran status, or disability, in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local legal requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Successful candidates might be required to undergo a background verification with an external vendor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;AI Usage in the Recruitment Process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;For information on the responsible use of AI in our recruitment process, please refer to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.sap.com/content/Ethical_usage_of_AI_in_the_recruiting_process/?locale=en_US&quot;&gt;Guidelines for Ethical Usage of AI in the Recruiting Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Please note that any violation of these guidelines may result in disqualification from the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requisition ID: 452436 &#160;| Work Area: Presales &#160;| Expected Travel: 0 - 10% &#160;| Career Status: Student &#160;| Employment Type: Limited Full Time &#160;&#160;| Additional Locations: &#160;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;We help the world run better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;At SAP, we keep it simple: you bring your best to us, and we&apos;ll bring out the best in you. We&apos;re builders touching over 20 industries and 80% of global commerce, and we need your unique talents to help shape what&apos;s next. The work is challenging &#8211; but it matters. You&apos;ll find a place where you can be yourself, prioritize your wellbeing, and truly belong. What&apos;s in it for you? Constant learning, skill growth, great benefits, and a team that wants you to grow and succeed.&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This role builds and scales a high-performing partner ecosystem for SAP Business Suite, with a focus on Cloud ERP, Finance (Office of the CFO), and Spend Management across Latin America, driving partner coverage, capability, and specialization to accelerate indirect revenue growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;It guides partner investment and development across SAP solutions, including Cloud ERP, Finance, Spend Management (Ariba), Data, Business Technology Platform, and AI, enabling partners to strengthen sales, co-innovation, and delivery capabilities. A key focus is developing Business Suite&#8211;ready partners by expanding and maturing Finance and Spend Management practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong ecosystem and channel development experience with a solid understanding of finance transformation, including financial planning and analysis, record-to-report, source-to-pay, and working capital optimization. They enable partners to position SAP&#8217;s value around business transformation and financial outcomes, leading with AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This role reports to the Regional Leader for the PES Ecosystem Development Team and is focused on the Latin America Market Unit (Mexico, Brazil, and Multi-Country). It supports the Finance &amp;amp; Spend Line of Business leaders, as well as Market Unit PBMs and CPOs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;text-decoration:underline&quot;&gt;Expectations &amp;amp; Tasks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Understand and align solution, sales, and partner GTM strategies across SAP Business Suite, Cloud ERP, Finance, and Spend Management priorities for Latin America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Assess the partner landscape and maintain a solution- and industry-specific heatmap to identify strengths, gaps, and market opportunities across the region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Articulate white space and guide partner recruitment, development, and expansion to build optimal coverage by geography, industry, and capability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Build and execute an ecosystem development plan to strengthen the partner network as an integrated whole&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Act as a strategic advisor to partners to improve win rates, grow their SAP business, and strengthen their ability to position and deliver Finance and Spend Management solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Increase partner capability across sales, presales, and implementation through targeted enablement, coaching, and practice development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Enable partners to lead finance and spend transformation conversations, including financial close, planning, procurement, supplier collaboration, and working capital optimization, with AI as a core component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Build ecosystem community and collaboration through scalable forums, engagement cadences, and best-practice sharing across Latin America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Act as a strategic advisor to SAP sales teams, promoting the right partners and driving effective partner engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Track partner performance and ecosystem health, including capability maturity, pipeline influence, and indirect revenue contribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Serve as the primary point of contact for regional and global stakeholders for coordination and development of the Finance and Spend Management partner ecosystem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Develop scalable programs to upskill and activate partners on SAP Business Suite, Cloud ERP, Finance, and Spend Management priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;text-decoration:underline&quot;&gt;Work Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; 10&#8211;15 years of overall business experience with 5+ years in cloud, ERP, Finance, or Spend Management&#8211;related roles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Strong experience in ecosystem development, channel strategy, partner business development, or indirect sales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Proven track record of building and scaling partner ecosystems in complex, multi-country environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Solid understanding of finance and/or procurement processes and enterprise transformation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Experience working across industries where finance transformation and spend optimization are strategic priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Strong understanding of partner-led and multi-channel go-to-market models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Ability to engage credibly with senior partner stakeholders, including business planning, whitespace analysis, and relationship building&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Strong communication and presentation skills with executive audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Experience working cross-functionally in matrixed environments with high accountability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Strong knowledge of Latin America markets and regional dynamics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Business-level English and Spanish required; Portuguese preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;text-decoration:underline&quot;&gt;Education and Qualifications / Skills and Competencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Bachelor&#8217;s degree in Business, Finance, IT, or related field, or equivalent experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Strong leadership, communication, and influencing skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Solid business and operational acumen, with ability to assess performance and drive action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Ability to operate effectively in complex, matrixed organizations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Strong analytical capability to assess partner performance, gaps, and market opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; Ability to bring structure to ambiguity and translate strategy into actionable plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&#183; High level of professionalism, resilience, and sound judgment under pressure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Bring out your best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP innovations help more than four hundred thousand customers worldwide work together more efficiently and use business insight more effectively. Originally known for leadership in enterprise resource planning (ERP) software, SAP has evolved to become a market leader in end-to-end business application software and related services for database, analytics, intelligent technologies, and experience management. As a cloud company with two hundred million users and more than one hundred thousand employees worldwide, we are purpose-driven and future-focused, with a highly collaborative team ethic and commitment to personal development. Whether connecting global industries, people, or platforms, we help ensure every challenge gets the solution it deserves. At SAP, you can bring out your best.&#160;&#160;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;We win with inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP&#8217;s culture of inclusion, focus on health and well-being, and flexible working models help ensure that everyone &#8211; regardless of background &#8211; feels included and can run at their best. At SAP, we believe we are made stronger by the unique capabilities and qualities that each person brings to our company, and we invest in our employees to inspire confidence and help everyone realize their full potential. We ultimately believe in unleashing all talent and creating a better world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP is committed to the values of Equal Employment Opportunity and provides accessibility accommodations to applicants with physical and/or mental disabilities. If you are interested in applying for employment with SAP and are in need of accommodation or special assistance to navigate our website or to complete your application, please send an e-mail with your request to Recruiting Operations Team: Careers@sap.com.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For SAP employees: Only permanent roles are eligible for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://one.int.sap/me@sap/jobs_and_hiring/employee_referral/region/0000/lang/en&quot;&gt;SAP Employee Referral Program&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;, according to the eligibility rules set in the SAP Referral Policy. Specific conditions may apply for roles in Vocational Training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to their age, race, religion, national origin, ethnicity,&#160; gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, et al), sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, protected veteran status, or disability, in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local legal requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Successful candidates might be required to undergo a background verification with an external vendor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;AI Usage in the Recruitment Process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;For information on the responsible use of AI in our recruitment process, please refer to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.sap.com/content/Ethical_usage_of_AI_in_the_recruiting_process/?locale=en_US&quot;&gt;Guidelines for Ethical Usage of AI in the Recruiting Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Please note that any violation of these guidelines may result in disqualification from the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requisition ID: 451459 &#160;| Work Area: Sales &#160;| Expected Travel: 0 - 30% &#160;| Career Status: Professional &#160;| Employment Type: Regular Full Time &#160;&#160;| Additional Locations: &#160;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;We help the world run better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;At SAP, we keep it simple: you bring your best to us, and we&apos;ll bring out the best in you. We&apos;re builders touching over 20 industries and 80% of global commerce, and we need your unique talents to help shape what&apos;s next. The work is challenging &#8211; but it matters. You&apos;ll find a place where you can be yourself, prioritize your wellbeing, and truly belong. What&apos;s in it for you? Constant learning, skill growth, great benefits, and a team that wants you to grow and succeed.&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&apos;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;The Head of AI GTM for Latin America &amp;amp; Caribbean (LAC)&#160;is a senior, high-impact leader responsible for driving measurable Business AI revenue and consumption outcomes across SAP&apos;s enterprise customer base throughout the entire LAC region. This role oversees the full commercial motion for SAP&apos;s Business AI portfolio &#8212; from demand creation through pipeline maturation and forecast delivery &#8212; while orchestrating cross-functional experts to build compelling, high-value proposals for SAP&apos;s premium AI use cases. As the single point of accountability for Business AI commercial performance across LAC, this leader oversees business execution in every market within the region, ensuring consistent strategy, local relevance, and unified revenue performance from Mexico to the Southern Cone and across the Caribbean.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning Demand, Pipeline &amp;amp; Forecast for Business AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end demand generation, pipeline health, and revenue forecast for Business AI across the full LAC region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Track, manage, and report pipeline coverage and conversion metrics with rigor, driving accountability across all LAC sales teams and market units&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Execute account-level GTM strategies that translate AI market opportunity into qualified pipeline across diverse LAC markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Proactively identify and close pipeline gaps through targeted campaigns, executive engagements, and field activation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Serve as the single point of accountability for Business AI commercial performance across the entire LAC region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing and Maturing Strategic AI Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Lead the design of complex, multi-solution Business AI opportunities from initial discovery through executive business case development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Qualify and mature strategic deals by mapping customer business priorities to SAP&apos;s premium AI portfolio and quantifying value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Facilitate AI Discovery Workshops and C-level engagements to accelerate deal progression and expand deal scope&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Build and evolve customer AI roadmaps that anchor long-term SAP commitment and create expansion opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Apply industry reference architecture and business process expertise to shape differentiated, defensible AI solution designs across LAC&apos;s key verticals and industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrating Experts to Win Premium AI Deals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Act as the deal quarterback &#8212; assembling and directing the right mix of presales, solution management, consulting, and partner experts to build winning proposals for SAP&apos;s premium AI use cases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Drive proposal quality and strategic narrative for marquee accounts across LAC, ensuring alignment between customer priorities and SAP&apos;s AI value proposition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Coordinate across SAP&apos;s Business AI ecosystem to deliver integrated, high-impact responses to complex customer requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Engage SAP&apos;s executive and partner network to accelerate deal closure on strategic AI opportunities throughout the region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activating the Field and Building AI Revenue Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Enable and activate LAC sales teams through ongoing commercial coaching, office hours, and deal strategy sessions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Lead quarterly business reviews and account planning across all LAC market units, with a sharp focus on AI pipeline growth and forecast accuracy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Build and leverage a professional network across LAC markets to generate pipeline and uncover new AI revenue opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Champion adoption of SAP&apos;s premium AI portfolio, ensuring sales teams across the region can confidently position and close Business AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Proven track record of delivering pipeline and revenue targets in enterprise software sales across Latin America and/or Caribbean markets, with direct accountability for forecast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of AI in a business context &#8212; both technical concepts and commercial applications &#8212; with experience positioning AI solutions to large enterprises&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Experience overseeing business execution across a broad, geographically diverse region, with the ability to adapt GTM strategies to varying market maturity levels and local business cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Experience orchestrating cross-functional teams (presales, solution management, consulting, partners) to execute complex, high-value deals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Ability to design and structure strategic AI opportunities from early qualification through close, including executive business case development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Familiarity with enterprise software sales cycles, CRM pipeline management, and AI commercial models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Proven leadership in driving urgency and execution across matrixed, multi-country organizations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Professional network across LAC markets capable of generating pipeline and influencing customer decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Full professional fluency in Spanish and Portuguese is essential;&#160;fluency in English is also required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Bachelor&apos;s degree or equivalent required; advanced degree is an asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet your team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;The AI GTM team is SAP&apos;s execution engine for Business AI revenue growth. We move fast, hold ourselves accountable to pipeline and forecast outcomes, and bring together the best of SAP&apos;s AI expertise to win in the market. We operate as deal architects and field activators &#8212; shaping the biggest AI opportunities while enabling the broader sales organization to compete and close with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;We are passionate about translating SAP&apos;s AI innovation into tangible customer outcomes and measurable business results across one of the world&apos;s most dynamic and diverse regions. If you thrive in a role where ownership, execution, and regional impact are the measures of success, this is where you belong.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Candidates will be required to work 3 days per week in office or client site per SAP&apos;s Pledge to Flex policy. Relocation benefits and visa sponsorship are not available for this role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0in;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Bring out your best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP innovations help more than four hundred thousand customers worldwide work together more efficiently and use business insight more effectively. Originally known for leadership in enterprise resource planning (ERP) software, SAP has evolved to become a market leader in end-to-end business application software and related services for database, analytics, intelligent technologies, and experience management. As a cloud company with two hundred million users and more than one hundred thousand employees worldwide, we are purpose-driven and future-focused, with a highly collaborative team ethic and commitment to personal development. Whether connecting global industries, people, or platforms, we help ensure every challenge gets the solution it deserves. At SAP, you can bring out your best.&#160;&#160;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;We win with inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP&#8217;s culture of inclusion, focus on health and well-being, and flexible working models help ensure that everyone &#8211; regardless of background &#8211; feels included and can run at their best. At SAP, we believe we are made stronger by the unique capabilities and qualities that each person brings to our company, and we invest in our employees to inspire confidence and help everyone realize their full potential. We ultimately believe in unleashing all talent and creating a better world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SAP is committed to the values of Equal Employment 